        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha arireha sanduku ra Mlungu na achiriika kahi-kahi ya hema ambaro kala Daudi akarichita kpwa ajili hiyo. Alafu alavya sadaka za kuochwa na sadaka za amani mbere za Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi ariphomala kulavya sadaka za kuochwa na sadaka za amani, waabariki atu kpwa dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tsona achiaganyira chila mutu wa Iziraeli, mlume kpwa mchetu bofulo, phande ra nyama na gande ra zabibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya hivyo, Daudi watsambula Alawi anjina akale a huduma mbere za sanduku ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, kuika kumbukumbu, kulavya shukurani na kutogola Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asafu kala ndiye mkpwulu, wa phiriwe kala ni Zakariya, alafu Jeieli, Shemiramothi, Jehieli, Matithia, Eliabu, Benaya, Obedi-Edomu na Jehieli. Hinyo ni apigadzi vinanda na ngephephe, Asafu kala ni mpigadzi matoazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao alavyadzi-sadaka Benaya na Jahazieli kano kpwa kano kala ni apigadzi tarumbeta mbere za sanduku ra chilagane ra Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ndiyo siku ambayo Daudi walagiza kpwa kano ya kpwandza kukala Asafu na abarie amlavire Mwenyezi Mlungu shukurani kpwa kuimba wira huno:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha atu osi achiamba, “Amina!” Mtogoleni Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi waaricha hiko mbere za sanduku ra chilagane ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, Asafu na nduguze, ili ahudumu mbere za sanduku kano kpwa kano dza vyo ilondwavyo kpwa iyo siku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na piya Obedi-Edomu na nduguze mirongo sita na anane arichwa ahudumu nao. Obedi-Edomu mwana wa Jeduthuni na Hosa akale arindzi a ryango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi waricha Sadoki yuya mlavyadzi-sadaka na nduguze, hara alavyadzi-sadaka mbere za hema ra Mwenyezi Mlungu kahi za phatu pha dzulu pha ibada hiko Gibioni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili amlavire Mwenyezi Mlungu sadaka za kuochwa dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka za kuochwa chila siku, ligundzu na dziloni, sawa-sawa na gosi garigoandikpwa ndani ya shariya ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ariyoalagiza Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phamwenga nao kala ni Hemani na Jeduthuni na hinyo anjina ariotsambulwa na madzina gao gachihadzwa kukala alavye shukurani kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, manage mendzwaye taisika ta kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hemani na Jeduthuni kala ni apiga tarumbeta na matoazi na kpwa ajili ya zumo na piya akala avumbadzi a vifwaya vyanjina vya mawira ga kumvwinira Mlungu. Ana a Jeduthuni atsambulwa arinde ryango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.19+2SA.6.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 6:19–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha atu osi achiphiya vyao chila mmwenga kpwakpwe kaya, naye Daudi achiphiya kaya kpwendabariki atue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
